  "description": "Stephen Hawking was a renowned theoretical physicist and cosmologist who lived with ALS (amyotrophic lateral sclerosis), a progressive neurodegenerative disease that left him physically disabled. His public image as a brilliant scientist despite his physical limitations makes him a target for ableist jokes, which the meme exploits by implying he was a source of spare parts.",
